# Project 2: Windows Authentication Attack Monitor Using Splunk

## 1. Project Overview

This project focuses on monitoring Windows authentication activity with Splunk Enterprise. It demonstrates how a SOC analyst can search Windows Security events, review failed and successful logons, identify suspicious authentication patterns, and document findings for further investigation.

This project complements Project 1, which focuses specifically on repeated failed login attempts. Project 2 takes a broader view of authentication activity and correlation.

